ngine/godot/pull/107866#issuecomment-3033450016","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107866","id":3033450016,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc60zsYg","user":{"login":"2frac","id":5622249,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2MjIyNDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5622249?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/2frac","html_url":"https://github.com/2frac","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/2frac/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/2frac/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/2frac/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/2frac/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/2frac/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/2frac/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/2frac/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/2frac/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/2frac/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-03T19:56:54Z","updated_at":"2025-07-03T19:56:54Z","body":"> That is where the translation from an ImporterMesh* node into the corresponding MeshInstance3D (or in this case, MultiMeshInstance3D) is happens in runtime import.\r\n\r\nIs GLTFDocumentExtensionConvertImporterMesh meant to do main conversion and code in _generate_meshes - whatever multimeshes been created by user extensions? \r\n\r\n> Finally, I'd love to see export code also added either here or in a future PR, so when a user exports a scene with a MultiMeshInstance3D, it creates the accessors and everything.\r\n\r\nI might try to look export, since i've got some time for that(but probably after main fixes)\r\nThis is not expected to be in my pipeline, however, so testing will be rather simple.\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3033450016/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3149717097","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107866#issuecomment-3149717097","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107866","id":3149717097,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc67vN5p","user":{"login":"RichardJECooke","id":5468805,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0Njg4MDU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5468805?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RichardJECooke","html_url":"https://github.com/RichardJECooke","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RichardJECooke/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RichardJECooke/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RichardJECooke/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RichardJECooke/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RichardJECooke/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RichardJECooke/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RichardJECooke/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RichardJECooke/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RichardJECooke/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-04T08:59:26Z","updated_at":"2025-08-04T08:59:26Z","body":"Will this enhancement fix [109280](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109280)? The file example there doesn't use `EXT_mesh_gpu_instancing`, but is just a few nodes that point to the same mesh in the gltf file. My example seems simpler/different, but I don't know enough about 3D files to know if this pull request will cover it or if I should look into another fix.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3149717097/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3150664643","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107866#issuecomment-3150664643","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107866","id":3150664643,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc67y1PD","user":{"login":"2frac","id":5622249,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2MjIyNDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5622249?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/2frac","html_url":"https://github.com/2frac","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/2frac/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/2frac/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/2frac/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/2frac/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/2frac/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/2frac/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/2frac/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/2frac/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/2frac/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-04T13:13:30Z","updated_at":"2025-08-04T13:13:30Z","body":"> Will this enhancement fix [109280](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109280)? The file example there doesn't use `EXT_mesh_gpu_instancing`\r\n\r\nIt should, actually. \"GPU instances\"+\"GN instances\" in blender option should create EXT_mesh_gpu_instancing entries in GLTF file - but for godot specifically this option added separately in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107672(which is semi-prerequisite to that PR). \r\n\r\nNot sure why is this not the case for example - it looks like it created without \"GPU instances\" option.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3150664643/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3172750687","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107866#issuecomment-3172750687","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107866","id":3172750687,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc69HFVf","user":{"login":"passivestar","id":60579014,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwNTc5MDE0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60579014?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar","html_url":"https://github.com/passivestar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-10T16:27:58Z","updated_at":"2025-08-10T16:27:58Z","body":"There needs to be a way to disable this in case the user wants to do own import logic via an addon (i.e to implement auto proximity clustering for better culling). It's fine if it's enabled by default though","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3172750687/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3172785529","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107866#issuecomment-3172785529","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107866","id":3172785529,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc69HN15","user":{"login":"aaronfranke","id":1646875,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NDY4NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1646875?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke","html_url":"https://github.com/aaronfranke","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-10T17:34:11Z","updated_at":"2025-08-10T17:34:11Z","body":"@passivestar This extension would only exist in a glTF file if the asset author explicitly indicated that they want control over batching. I think it would be best to re-export such a file with different settings if this wasn't wanted.\r\n\r\nHowever, even so, you'll be able to disable this (and any other GLTFDocumentExtension) implicitly by registering a new extension with higher priority, overriding the behavior.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3172785529/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3172794747","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107866#issuecomment-3172794747","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107866","id":3172794747,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc69HQF7","user":{"login":"passivestar","id":60579014,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwNTc5MDE0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60579014?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar","html_url":"https://github.com/passivestar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-10T17:52:39Z","updated_at":"2025-08-10T17:52:39Z","body":"> @passivestar This extension would only exist in a glTF file if the asset author explicitly indicated that they want control over batching. I think it would be best to re-export such a file with different settings if this wasn't wanted.\r\n\r\nyou'd want the extension enabled on export to make sure you write instances to `.bin` but have custom import logic to have control over how that binary data is converted into multimesh nodes\r\n\r\n> However, even so, you'll be able to disable this (and any other GLTFDocumentExtension) implicitly by registering a new extension with higher priority, overriding the behavior.\r\n\r\ngood","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3172794747/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3554752549","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107866#issuecomment-3554752549","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107866","id":3554752549,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7T4Tgl","user":{"login":"2frac","id":5622249,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2MjIyNDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5622249?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/2frac","html_url":"https://github.com/2frac","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/2frac/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/2frac/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/2frac/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/2frac/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/2frac/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/2frac/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/2frac/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/2frac/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/2frac/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-19T21:44:51Z","updated_at":"2025-11-19T21:44:51Z","body":"Closing PR for now, as there is [better implementation](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112866) now.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3554752549/reactions","total_